OL,3,AOutspoken Indian actor Nana Patekar
OL,4,Adies suddenly at 75
OL,5,
OL,6,FVeteran Indian actor Nana Patekar,
OL,7,Fknown for his intense, fiery
OL,8,Fperformances on stage and in film, has
OL,9,Fdied at the age of 75 in Goa.
OL,11,FOne of the most recognisable faces of
OL,12,FIndian cinema, Patekar won three
OL,13,FNational Film Awards and became known
OL,14,Ffor playing difficult and often
OL,15,Fvolatile characters. He was also a
OL,16,Fprominent figure in Marathi language
OL,17,Fcinema and theatre.
OL,19,FHe was admitted to a hospital after
OL,20,Fbeing found unconscious at his home in
OL,21,FGoa in the early hours of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
