OL,3,AOutspoken Indian actor Nana Patekar
OL,4,Adies suddenly at 75
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Despite 45 minutes of continuous CPR,
OL,7,Fhe could not be revived," Dr Shekhar
OL,8,FSalkar of Manipal Hospital in Goa told
OL,9,FANI news agency. Tributes have poured
OL,10,Fin from actors and politicians across
OL,11,FIndia.
